# components/dataplane/ae-system-project/ae-studio/ae-collab — the AE Studio Room (#86)

# Dev mode: the pod's listeners (public 8081, health 9081, local 127.0.0.1:8091)
# with auth bypassed, rooms seeded from fixtures over a fake Files socket and
# flushes committed into it. Explicit only (`pnpm dev` sets it). Never in a
# cluster: a pod env (AE_ORG_ID set) carrying it fails the boot.
#COLLAB_DEV=1
#AE_LISTEN_PORT=8081
#AE_HEALTH_PORT=9081
#AE_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173

# Pod mode is rendered by the AE Studio pod (AE_ORG_ID, AE_ORG_HANDLE,
# AE_IDP_ISSUER, AE_IDP_JWKS_URL, AE_USER_AUDIENCES, AE_AGENT_CLIENT_ID,
# AE_ALLOWED_ORIGINS, AE_FILES_SOCKET); see AGENTS.md.
